      "zh": {
        "title": "國防部偵獲七艘共艦及六艘公務船台海周邊活動",
        "summary": "國防部偵獲七艘共艦與六艘公務船在台海周邊活動，期間未偵獲共機。",
        "body": [
          "中華民國國防部於8月21日上午發布中共解放軍台海周邊動態。自8月20日上午6時至21日上午6時止，共偵獲共艦7艘及公務船6艘，持續在台海周邊活動。國軍運用任務機、艦及岸置飛彈系統進行嚴密監控與應處。",
          "國防部指出，在此24小時期間內，並未偵獲任何共機在台海周邊活動，因此未提供航跡圖。",
          "根據本站統計紀錄，8月20日共偵獲共機5架次、共艦8艘及公務船6艘。此外，近7日平均每日偵獲共機8.8架次、共艦8.5艘；近30日平均則為共機6.8架次、共艦8.0艘。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Taiwan Detects 7 Chinese Warships and 6 Official Vessels Around Taiwan Strait",
        "summary": "Taiwan's defense ministry detects seven Chinese military vessels and six official vessels near Taiwan Strait.",
        "body": [
          "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense announced that 7 Chinese military vessels and 6 official vessels were detected operating around the Taiwan Strait from 6 a.m. on August 20 to 6 a.m. on August 21, 2026. Taiwan's military deployed mission aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems to closely monitor and respond to the activities.",
          "During this 24-hour period, no Chinese military aircraft were detected around the Taiwan Strait, and no flight path map was provided by the ministry.",
          "According to AVWIRE database statistics, 5 Chinese military aircraft, 8 military vessels, and 6 official vessels were recorded on August 20. Over the past 7 days, the daily average stood at 8.8 aircraft and 8.5 vessels, while the 30-day daily average was 6.8 aircraft and 8.0 vessels."
        ]
      },
